<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3868/73  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7243/53  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9407/12  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4445/55  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.60/61   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8307/17  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1696.8/7.8 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     114.40/50  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7757/32  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.1770/20  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5672/99  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One sterling     US$1.6321/33</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$342.15/45</p>
</text>
